  ($q$travel$q$, $q$Travel: Getting Around$q$, $q$gaan-dəən-thaang$q$, $q$Real Thai for getting around Thailand: vehicles, buses, trains, taxis, buying tickets, asking directions, and checking into a hotel — from Essential Thai by James Higbie.$q$, 6)
