  ($q$t02$q$, $q$travel$q$, 1, $q$How are you going? Bus, train, taxi$q$, $j$[{"id":"rule-15","type":"rule","title":"\"By\" isn't needed","body":"Thai doesn't use a word for \"by\" — \"I'm going by bus\" is just \"go-bus\" (pai + the vehicle name), with nothing in between.","source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"wi-16","type":"wordIntro","word":{"thai":"รถเมล์","roman":"rót-mee","english":"bus"},"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"mc-154","type":"translationChoice","thai":"ไปรถเมล์","roman":"pai rót-mee","options":[{"text":"I'm going by tuk-tuk.","correct":false},{"text":"I'm going by taxi.","correct":false},{"text":"I'm going by bus.","correct":true},{"text":"I'm going by train.","correct":false}],"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34","parts":["ไป","รถเมล์"]},{"id":"sp-159","type":"speak","thai":"ไปรถเมล์","roman":"pai rót-mee","meaning":"I'm going by bus.","source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34","parts":["ไป","รถเมล์"]},{"id":"wi-17","type":"wordIntro","word":{"thai":"รถไฟ","roman":"rót-fai","english":"train"},"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"so-155","type":"sentenceOrder","prompt":"I'm going by train.","tileUnit":"word","words":{"a":{"roman":"pai","thai":"ไป"},"b":{"roman":"rót-fai","thai":"รถไฟ"},"x0":{"thai":"ภูเก็ต","roman":"phuu-gèt"},"x1":{"thai":"ไหน","roman":"nǎi"}},"poolOrder":["a","b","x1","x0"],"correctOrder":["a","b"],"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"so-158","type":"sentenceOrder","prompt":"I'm going to Bangkok by train.","tileUnit":"word","words":{"a":{"roman":"pai","thai":"ไป"},"b":{"roman":"grung-thêep","thai":"กรุงเทพฯ"},"c":{"roman":"rót-fai","thai":"รถไฟ"},"x0":{"thai":"ไหน","roman":"nǎi"},"x1":{"thai":"รถเมล์","roman":"rót-mee"}},"poolOrder":["x0","b","c","a","x1"],"correctOrder":["a","b","c"],"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"wi-22","type":"wordIntro","word":{"thai":"แท็กซี่","roman":"thák-sîi","english":"taxi"},"source":"Essential Thai (Higbie), p.34"},{"id":"mc-156","ty